('06_Ecommerce_Marketplaces_B2B_and_LinkedIn_Growth','13','Marketplace operating cadence','For marketplace growth, review product titles, bullets, images, reviews, inventory status, delivery promise, price competitiveness, ad spend, search terms, conversion rate and return reasons. Separate marketplace performance from D2C performance because the customer data, ranking mechanics and margin structure differ.','Ecommerce Marketplaces B2B and LinkedIn Growth'),
('06_Ecommerce_Marketplaces_B2B_and_LinkedIn_Growth','13','B2B account planning model','A UAE B2B plan should define named accounts, buying committee roles, relationship status, business trigger, sector priorities, Arabic/English collateral needs, event touchpoints, LinkedIn targeting, CRM stages, proposal owner and executive sponsor.','Ecommerce Marketplaces B2B and LinkedIn Growth'),
('06_Ecommerce_Marketplaces_B2B_and_LinkedIn_Growth','13','Lead quality feedback loop','Marketing and sales should meet weekly to classify leads as qualified, unqualified, duplicate, unreachable, wrong geography, wrong budget, wrong sector or timing mismatch. Campaign optimization should be based on this feedback rather than platform lead volume alone.','Ecommerce Marketplaces B2B and LinkedIn Growth'),
('06_Ecommerce_Marketplaces_B2B_and_LinkedIn_Growth','13','File-Level Verification Notes','- This file is based on source collector packets generated in July 2026.
